# Line endings
# .bat/.cmd/.ps1: store bytes as-is (CRLF) - cmd.exe cannot parse LF batch files.
# Do NOT use "text eol=crlf" here: git would still store LF in the blob, and raw
# downloads / archives would ship LF, causing the bat to abort instantly on Windows.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.ps1 -text
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
